---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const CONTACT = "pritform@gmail.com";
const UPDATED = "18 November 2026";
---

<Layout
	title="Terms of service"
	description="The rules behind BEUConnect: an unofficial student project, what a result lookup shares, and how to have it removed."
>
	<article class="terms">
		<header class="terms-head">
			<p class="eyebrow">Terms of service</p>
			<h1>The rules, in plain words</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				Using BEUConnect means accepting these terms. They are short because the app is
				small: no account, no payment, no advertising.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section aria-labelledby="what">
			<h2 id="what">What this is</h2>
			<p>
				BEUConnect is an unofficial student project, built and run by one person — Prit, at
				GEC Sheikhpura. It is <strong>not affiliated with Bihar Engineering University</strong>
				and is not an official BEU service. Results, notices and papers are copied from
				BEU's own published pages so they are easier to read on a phone.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="results">
			<h2 id="results">Results you look up</h2>
			<p>
				Looking up a result sends that result, keyed by your registration number and semester,
				to a shared store that any student can read by looking up the same number and semester.
			</p>
			<p>
				This is on by default, and there is no setting to turn it off. If you do not want
				your result shared, do not use result lookup. Every other feature — syllabus,
				papers, notices, routine, attendance, calculators — works without it.
			</p>
			<p>
				To have your row removed, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a> with the
				registration number. It is removed within 30 days, and you do not have to explain
				why.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="leaves">
			<h2 id="leaves">What leaves your phone</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>The result you looked up, keyed by your registration number and semester.</li>
				<li>The guardian mobile number you enter, when you sync attendance.</li>
				<li>The text you send as feedback.</li>
				<li>
					Anonymous app-activity events — the screen, the action, branch/college/batch
					codes, app version — and a random client id.
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				That is the whole list. The <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> explains what is
				never collected and how to switch analytics off.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="no">
			<h2 id="no">No account, no ads, no selling</h2>
			<p>
				There is no sign-up, no password and no payment. There are no ads and no ad
				trackers. We do not sell data and do not share it for advertising.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="accuracy">
			<h2 id="accuracy">Accuracy</h2>
			<p>
				Results are copied from BEU and can be wrong, incomplete or late. They are a
				convenience, not the record. Always check the official BEU portal before relying
				on a result for anything that matters.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="changes">
			<h2 id="changes">Changes to these terms</h2>
			<p>
				Last updated <strong>{UPDATED}</strong>. If a change matters, the date changes and
				the app's About screen says so.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="card contact" aria-labelledby="contact">
			<h2 id="contact">Questions</h2>
			<p>
				<a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a>
			</p>
			<p class="fine">
				Unofficial student project. Not affiliated with Bihar Engineering University.
			</p>
		</section>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.terms {
		max-width: 48rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding-block: var(--s6) var(--s8);
	}

	.terms-head {
		margin-bottom: var(--s5);
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 var(--s2);
		color: var(--accent);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.terms h1 {
		margin: 0 0 var(--s3);
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.9rem);
		line-height: 1.05;
	}

	.lede {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.terms h2 {
		margin-top: var(--s6);
		margin-bottom: var(--s3);
		font-size: 1.35rem;
	}

	.terms p,
	.terms li {
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.terms ul {
		padding-left: 1.1rem;
	}

	.terms li + li {
		margin-top: var(--s1);
	}

	.card {
		padding: var(--s4) var(--s5);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 14px;
		background: var(--surface-2);
	}

	.contact {
		margin-top: var(--s7);
	}

	.contact h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	.contact p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.fine {
		margin-top: var(--s2) !important;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.card {
			padding: var(--s3) var(--s4);
		}
	}
</style>
